  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Assuming complete separation of charges (i.e. +e, -e on two ends)<br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4.802</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>×</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1.617</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>7.76</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>18</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7.76</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></math><br /><br />Fractional charge on dipole ends <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>0.38</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>7.76</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>≅</mo><mn>0.05</mn></math>",
